# --- work/ holds the render supervisors, thermal guard and image renderer that
# local_agent imports. Track the source there; keep its runtime state out.
# (The earlier blanket `work/` rule above is overridden by these lines.)
!work/
work/*
!work/*.py
!work/*.md
!work/README*
